 "side": "Dark",
 "description": "A Character based RalOps deck that revolves around controlling and dealing out huge damage from Ralltiir.",
 "strategy": "At the start of the game the focus should be to get as many powerful characters to Ralltiir as possible.  Use Blaster Rack (v) to pull matching sabers and other weapons.  If you do not have Emperor on the table when you flip that should be the first card you pull using in the hands of the emperor.  With all of the powerful characters and react ability in this deck it shouldn't be too difficult to dominate 3 Ralltiir sites. Get Overseeing personally on the Emperor to add to the drains.  Between Lightsabers and overseeing it personally drains should be massive.  Playing Mosep in the middle of Ralltiir also can cause serious problems to your a opponents ability to deal with the drains.  Hutt Smooch and Lt. Pol are their to deal with Undercover spies, and Death Mark is used to draw opponent to Ralltiir or place on Han in a Profit deck.\n\nI included Guri and Stinger, to help deal with a Hidden base deck.\n\nThe Podrace should be used later in the game when it is unexpected.",
